description:
게임 정보
고딕풍의 불멸하는 세계를 배경으로 한 이 번개처럼 빠른 핵 앤 슬래시 로그라이크에서 돌진하고, 쏘고, 공격하세요!
이동 능력, 순간적인 의사 결정, 그리고 스타일리시한 연속 공격에 초점을 맞춘 Bloodrush는 능력들을 조합하여 적을 파괴하는 창의적인 전투 접근 방식을 장려합니다!
무기 공격과 이동 능력을 결합하여 새로운 콤보를 만드세요;
항상 돌아올 기회가 있습니다 - 적을 처형하여 체력을 회복하기 위해 돌진하세요;
무기를 다양하게 사용하고 신속하게 처치하여 스타일을 얻고 더 많은 체력을 회복하세요.
다양한 적과 보스들이 죽음의 해방을 가로막고 영원의 교단을 형성합니다;
각기 다른 메커니즘과 상호작용할 수 있는 도전 과제를 가진 8개의 전투 경기장에서 춤을 추세요;

게임 정보
Block Crush: A Revolutionary Match Puzzle Game
Crafted over 4 years of dedicated development, Block Crush introduces an unprecedented puzzle experience! Unlike traditional match-3, tap-to-clear, or line-clearing games, our cover-clear mechanism redefines puzzle-solving in match games with strategic depth. Gear up to challenge your mind, master block placement, and crush scores like never before!
Core Gameplay: Strategic Cover Clear
Goal: Use limited block props in each level to precisely cover and clear all squares to complete the stage.
Challenges:
▶ Running out of blocks before clearing all squares = failure – plan every block’s position and coverage carefully;
▶ Collect colorful skill items (e.g., green, blue, red) and combine them strategically for chain eliminations;
▶ Aim for high scores by mastering optimal block placement and skill usage!
Mechanic Highlights:
✔ A unique cover-clearance algorithm ensures each level offers distinct puzzle logic, free from repetitive patterns;
✔ Pause to strategize before dragging blocks – maximize each move’s coverage to clear levels smarter, not harder!
Game Features: Casual Fun Meets Brain-Teasing Depth
Flexible Playtime: From seconds-long quick clears to minutes of deep strategic thinking – perfect for both short breaks and immersive play;
Diverse Modes:
▶ Main Campaign: Meticulously designed levels with escalating difficulty;
▶ Bonus Reward: Unlock beautiful background artworks upon completion – collectible rewards for your achievements;
Genre: Casual Puzzle + Strategic Elimination – suitable for all ages to exercise problem-solving skills.
Why Block Crush?
✅ Innovative Mechanic: Break free from traditional match norms with the "cover" concept;
✅ Craftsmanship: 4 years of refinement ensures every level is logically sound and endlessly engaging;
✅ Easy to Learn, Hard to Master: Simple controls hide layers of strategic depth – once you start, you won’t want to stop!

게임 정보

In the world of Web Host Simulator, you'll establish a web hosting company from your small apartment, aiming to become the leading hosting service provider. But success requires more than attracting customers; you must also handle challenges like cyberattacks, outages and others events!
Key Features
Diverse game modes: Career, sandbox and training;
Different types of product for sale: Hosting reseller, Shared hosting, VPS, Cloud, Dedicated server and more;
Different types of equipment: Routers, firewalls, servers, UPS and more;
Random events: Face power outages, hacker attacks and more;
Hardware assembly: Assemble and optimize equipment;
Immersive environments: Navigate graphical and command-line operating systems;
Internet in-game: Explore immersive websites;
Realistic cables: Manage cables with real-time physics simulation;
Upcoming features: Stay tuned for updates during development.

Ready to turn your apartment into a hosting provider empire?

게임 정보
Dangerous Galaxy is a rogue-lite with physics-based combat and extensive ship upgrading, where you explore procedurally generated star systems, manage resources, and fight enemies and boss battles to save the galaxy from evil. 
Extensive ship upgrading system:
Different main weapons that you can choose before each run;
Freedom to add or stack upgrades however you want;
Upgrade leveling - Each active upgrade has an upgrade path that you can choose;
Active abilities - The player can hold 4 active abilities at any time.
Fun physics-based combat:
Every object (including the player) can be pushed away, bumped into or destroyed;
Active abilities (like rockets) can create explosions or gravity-altering effects.

게임 정보
They say that if you want something immensely, it will definitely come true. Those who wish to realize their dream receive a supernatural ability — the way to its fulfillment! A high school student, Tyler discovers such a power in himself: the talent to control the flame, which henceforth serves as his second heart. Meanwhile, it turns out that his friend Jean also has an unusual gift: he can command time. But who are these mysterious ghosts that roam around? Are these persecutions somehow connected with the boys' magic?

Visual novel, adventure, slice of life, fantasy, romance, shounen-ai, comedy, drama, school.

• colorful illustrations;
• romantic scenes;
• original soundtrack;
• dark atmosphere and mysterious plot.

게임 정보
Many Things Can Change After A Trauma.

For Nathan, the way he saw the world was affected after being shot in a robbery. When he acquires a new skill, he finds himself immersed in a sucession of events that, one by one, shakes the pillars of his already fragile life.
Technical Facts
Multiple endings: your choices matter;
About 5 hours of gameplay;
15+ backgrounds and 15+ CGs;
20+ original songs.

